Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:46.40,H_id,,0,0,0,,"Aku tidak takut. Aku sudah punya altar. Aku pembasmi setan."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:46.40,C_id,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episode GRATIS ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.81,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku takut apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.85,0:00:03.81,S_id,,0,0,0,,Altarku sudah berdiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.85,0:00:05.81,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku pembasmi arwah jahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.85,0:00:06.88,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kamu siapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:09.00,S_id,,0,0,0,,Berani-beraninya masuk begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:14.14,S_id,,0,0,0,,Itu dewa arwah yang baru kami rekrut.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:15.14,S_id,,0,0,0,,Dia sudah lulus asesmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.17,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bocah ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:18.17,S_id,,0,0,0,,lihat dulu dengan jelas baru bicara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:19.17,S_id,,0,0,0,,Jadi rasa tidak nyaman itu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.21,0:00:21.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,itu karena dia?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:23.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,Dia menumpang di tubuhmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:24.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kau tak merasakan dia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:26.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,atau mengirimnya ke aula belakang berlatih,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:27.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,makanya tidak nyaman sampai sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:28.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kenapa tidak bilang dari tadi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.63,0:00:29.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kalian yang merekrutnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:30.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,Setelah diperiksa,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:31.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,kirim saja dia langsung ke aula belakang —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.63,0:00:32.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,kan beres begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:33.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,Tidak masuk akal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,Altar punya aturan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:36.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,Ketika arwah masuk,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:37.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,medium harus tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.63,0:00:38.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,dan harus menanyakannya jelas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:39.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kalau tidak, kucing atau anjing apa saja
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.63,0:00:41.59,S_id,,0,0,0,,bisa berlatih di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:44.42,S_id,,0,0,0,,Boleh tahu nama dewa arwah ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.42,S_id,,0,0,0,,Berasal dari mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:46.40,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kekuatan apa yang kau punya?
